Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.76,0:04:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[邪恶力量 第2季第2集]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.33,0:00:03.01,CMCT中文字幕,,0,0,0,,(忆往昔)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.22,0:01:32.58,CMCT中文字幕,,0,0,0,,(现在)
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.31,0:01:37.81,CMCT中文字幕,,0,0,0000,,(梅德福   威斯康星州)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.02,0:05:40.35,CMCT中文字幕,,0,0,0000,,(一周后)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.16,0:00:04.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想爸爸想要我们继承他的遗志{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad wants us to pick up where he left off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.06,0:00:07.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,救助他人 猎杀恶魔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saving people,hunting things...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.05,0:00:08.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,家族事业{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the family business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.28,0:00:12.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.05,0:00:13.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.89,0:00:15.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是在做梦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's not a dream.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.18,0:00:17.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你听说过灵魂出窍这回事吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever heard of an out of body experience?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.20,0:00:18.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们是鬼魂…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It means that we're spirits...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:21.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,人们濒死时出窍的灵魂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}of people close to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.10,0:00:26.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你的儿子快死了 你还在担心柯尔特？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your son is dying and you're worried about the Colt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.43,0:00:29.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,向我的心脏开枪 儿子 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You shoot me in the heart, son.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:32.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是不是把那个魔鬼引来了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're planning on bringing the demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.91,0:00:35.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,愚蠢地想要和他一决高下？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Having some stupid, macho showdown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.98,0:00:38.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果你当时就杀了那个魔鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you killed that damn thing,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.19,0:00:40.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这一切就不会发生了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}none of this would have happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.15,0:00:48.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想做个交易{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanna make a deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.30,0:00:52.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你比上一个死神漂亮多了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're prettier than the last reaper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.44,0:00:55.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我会给你柯尔特和子弹 但你得帮助迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will give you the Colt and the bullet, but you gotta help Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.29,0:00:58.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,成交了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So we have a deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.54,0:01:01.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你还得付出更多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still need to sweeten the pot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.13,0:01:06.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,今天是你的幸运日 小子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Today's your lucky day, kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.35,0:01:10.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你来看着萨姆 行吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You watch out for Sammy, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.82,0:01:19.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.24,0:01:21.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:27.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,死亡时间 上午10:41{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Time of death, 10:41 a.m.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.81,0:01:45.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,国王的火{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}King of fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.44,0:01:56.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我讨厌小丑 总是让我毛骨悚然{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}God, I hate clowns.They always creep me out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.08,0:01:57.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘘 她喜欢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shh. She likes them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.16,0:02:08.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,最后一次了 诺拉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Last ride, Nora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:24.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,快看 妈妈 又一个小丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Mom, another clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.69,0:02:31.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你想干什么 吓唬你爸爸吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you trying to do, scare your father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.65,0:02:32.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,亲爱的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.93,0:02:50.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,快看 妈妈 小丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, Mom, the clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.48,0:02:57.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你错过了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You missed him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:53.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他之前…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before he{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.68,0:04:55.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他之前…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before he{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.67,0:05:02.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,和你说过什么吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did he say anything to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.81,0:05:06.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,任何事？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About anything?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.84,0:05:15.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.42,0:05:20.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么也没说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.02,0:06:01.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,车修的怎样了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How this car coming along?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.46,0:06:02.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,早着呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Slow.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.42,0:06:04.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.65,0:06:07.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,需要帮忙吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need any help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.44,0:06:08.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？是你在车底吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What, you under a hood?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.54,0:06:10.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不用了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll pass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.29,0:06:14.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,其他的呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Need anything else, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.99,0:06:18.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别说了 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop it, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.88,0:06:19.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.73,0:06:21.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别再问我是否需要什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop asking if I need anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.07,0:06:23.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别再问我有事没事 我很好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop asking if I'm okay. I'm okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.89,0:06:25.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真的 我保证{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really. I promise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.67,0:06:31.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧 迪恩 只是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right. Dean, it's just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.67,0:06:34.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们已经在鲍比这呆了一周了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We've been at Bobby's for a week and{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.40,0:06:35.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你也一次都没提过爸爸的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you haven't brought up Dad once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.55,0:06:38.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道吗？你说对了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what? You're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.07,0:06:41.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,靠近点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.44,0:06:43.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这样我可以把头靠在你的肩膀上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm wanna lay my head gently on your shoulder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.47,0:06:45.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许我们可以抱着痛哭一场{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe we can cry, hug.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.72,0:06:48.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 也许再来段慢舞 - 别敷衍我了 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Maybe even slow dance. - Don't patronize me, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.23,0:06:51.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸死了柯尔特枪也不见了 很明显地{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad is dead.The Colt is gone and it seems pretty damn likely{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.67,0:06:54.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是那个魔鬼在搞鬼 但你却当什么事都没发生过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the demon is behind all this, and you're acting like nothing's happened{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.30,0:06:55.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 为什么说？- 随便说些什么 可以吗？ {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why saySay something, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.75,0:06:59.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说点什么吧 难道你不愤怒？不想报仇吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hell, say anything. Aren't you angry? Don't you want revenge?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.27,0:07:02.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,可你现在只知道蹲在这里修这辆烂车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But all you do it You sit out here all day long, buried underneath this car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.64,0:07:04.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 报仇？- 是啊 - 听起来不错{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Revenge, huh? - Yeah. - Sounds good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.24,0:07:07.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,知道那魔鬼在哪吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got any leads on where the demon is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.13,0:07:09.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,弄懂老爸的那些研究了吗？我是没有啦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You making heads or tails of Dad's research? I sure aingt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.91,0:07:11.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就算我找到了它…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you know, when we do finally find it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.57,0:07:12.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}oh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:14.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 等等 你说了 柯尔特不见了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, wait. Like you said, the Colt's gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.59,0:07:16.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但我猜你肯定会找到其他方法的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sure you've figured out a way to kill it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.64,0:07:18.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们什么都没有 萨姆 什么都没{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got nothing, Sam. Nothing, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:21.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我唯一能做的就是修车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, the only thing I can do, is I can work on the car.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.98,0:07:25.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们不是什么都没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we got something, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.53,0:07:28.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这就是我来找你的原因{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's what I came to tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.16,0:07:29.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是爸爸其中一个旧手机{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's one of Dad's old phones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.64,0:07:32.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我花了很长时间才解开语音信箱的密码 听听这{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Took me a while, but I cracked his voice mail.Listen to this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.98,0:07:39.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,约翰 我是埃伦… 又是我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}John, it's Ellen. Again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.35,0:07:42.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别固执了 你知道我帮的到你 回我电话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, don't be stubborn. You know I can help you. Call me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.57,0:07:45.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那条信息是4个月前的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That message is four months old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.22,0:07:47.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,老爸把那个女人的信息保留了4个月？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad saved that for four months?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.01,0:07:48.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 埃伦是谁？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah - Who's Ellen?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.25,0:07:49.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 老爸的日记里有提到吗？- 没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any mention of her in Dad's journal? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:52.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是我查了下电话号码 找到了地址{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But I ran a trace on the phone number and I got an address.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:57.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,问问鲍比 我们是不是可以用一下他的车{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ask Bobby if we can use one of his cars.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.60,0:08:10.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这真是羞辱{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is humiliating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.15,0:08:16.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我感觉像是可怜的家庭主妇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I feel like a frigging soccer mom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.36,0:08:18.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这是鲍比那唯一一辆可以开的车了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the only car Bobby had running.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.61,0:08:22.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有人吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.98,0:08:26.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 有人吗？- 好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Anybody here? - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.75,0:08:28.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 你有带… - 当然带了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you bring the... ? - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.23,0:08:59.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 伙计？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, buddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.49,0:09:05.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我猜他一定不是埃伦了 - 是啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm guessing that isn't Ellen. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.98,0:09:26.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 别告诉我那是来福枪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, God, please let that be a rifle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.87,0:09:28.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 我真的很高兴能见到你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'm just real happy to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.38,0:09:31.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 别动 - 不动 我知道了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Don't move. - Not moving. Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.07,0:09:34.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你该知道 小姐{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You should know something, Miss{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.62,0:09:36.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当你用来福枪顶着人时{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}When you put a rifle on someone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.31,0:09:38.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你最好不要顶着他们的背{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you won't put it right against their back...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.61,0:09:40.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,因为那样很容易就会…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}because it makes it real easy to do{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.54,0:09:44.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这样 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.62,0:09:46.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.97,0:09:48.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我需要点帮助{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I need some help in here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.33,0:09:49.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我看不见了 看不见了 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can't see. I can't even see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.11,0:09:51.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, Dean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.88,0:09:53.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我现在不行 我…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't right now. I'm, uh,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.29,0:09:55.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,被抓了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a little tied up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.37,0:09:59.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 迪恩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam? Dean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.69,0:10:02.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,温彻斯特家的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Winchester?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.01,0:10:04.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.75,0:10:06.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,该死的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Son of a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.91,0:10:08.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,妈 你认识他们？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mom, you know these guys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.21,0:10:10.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 我想他们是约翰·温彻斯特的儿子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, I think these are John Winchester's boys.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.94,0:10:14.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 我叫埃伦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I'm Ellen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.35,0:10:16.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是我的女儿 乔{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My daughter, Jo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:18.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.19,0:10:20.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不会再打我了吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're not gonna hit me again, are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.79,0:10:22.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,给你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.86,0:10:23.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:28.96,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你打过电话给我们的爸爸 说你可以帮忙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You called our dad, said you could help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.59,0:10:30.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,帮什么忙？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help with what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.00,0:10:33.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗯{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.67,0:10:35.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,当然是那个魔鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the demon, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.92,0:10:38.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我听说他找到它了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I heard he was closing in on it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.60,0:10:42.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,难道我在《猎魔周刊》漏看什么了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was there an article in Demon Hunters Quarterly that I missed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.13,0:10:43.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我是说你是谁？- 你是怎么知道这些事的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who are you? - How do you know this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.79,0:10:45.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 我只是开酒吧的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, I just run a saloon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.04,0:10:49.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是猎手们也经常路过这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But hunters have been known to pass through now and again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.64,0:10:51.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你爸爸很久前也来过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Including your dad a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.68,0:10:53.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 约翰那时就像家人一样 - 哦 是的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- John was like family once. - Oh, yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.25,0:10:55.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说他从没提起过你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How come he's never mentioned you before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.06,0:10:57.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那你得问他啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You'd have to ask him that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.81,0:11:02.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么 我们能帮你们什么忙？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why exactly do we need your help?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.51,0:11:04.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 不用勉强{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, don't do me any favors.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.65,0:11:06.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你瞧 如果不需要帮忙可以{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look, if you don't want my help, fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.29,0:11:08.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,要离开的话，你走的时候干脆点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't let the door smack your ass on the way out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.47,0:11:10.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是约翰一般不会让你们来的 除非…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But John wouldn't have sent you if{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.18,0:11:17.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是他叫你们来的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He didn't send you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.91,0:11:25.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他还好吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's all right, isn't he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.96,0:11:27.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.33,0:11:30.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 他不好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, he isn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.71,0:11:32.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们觉得是那魔鬼干的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It was the demon, we think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:36.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想它比他早了一步{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It just got him before he got it, I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.11,0:11:42.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我很抱歉 - 没关系{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm so sorry. - It's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.27,0:11:43.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们都很好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.71,0:11:45.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是吗？我清楚你们和你们的爸爸的关系…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really? I know how close you and your dad{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.66,0:11:47.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真的 女士 我很好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Really,Lady. I'm fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.15,0:11:53.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你瞧 如果你能帮忙…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So look. If you can help...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.59,0:11:56.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们可以用上一切有用的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we could use all the help we can get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.07,0:11:58.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嗯 我们不行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, we can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.80,0:12:01.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但阿什行{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Ash will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.08,0:12:03.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 谁是阿什？- 阿什 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Who's Ash? - Ash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.81,0:12:05.94,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.91,0:12:09.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,关门了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Closing time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.70,0:12:12.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 他就是阿什？- 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That's Ash? - Mm - hm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.91,0:12:14.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他是个天才{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.78,0:12:19.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,开玩笑吧 这家伙是天才{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be kidding. He's no genius.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.92,0:12:21.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他就像是Lynyrd Skynyrd乐队里打杂的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's a Lynyrd Skynyrd roadie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.29,0:12:24.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我喜欢你 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I like you. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.71,0:12:25.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就让他试试吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just give him a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.88,0:12:31.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.32,0:12:36.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这些我老爸一年的劳动成果 所以…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This stuff's a year's worth of our dad's work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.49,0:12:38.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,让我们看看你能懂多少{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So let's see what you make of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.75,0:12:52.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,拜托 这些东西不是真的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. This crap aingt real.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.20,0:12:54.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没人能用这个来追踪一个魔鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There aingt nobody that can track a demon like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.81,0:13:00.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们的爸爸可以{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our dad could.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.03,0:13:05.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这些是非参数的统计数据{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are nonparametric statistical overviews.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:08.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,交叉光谱的相互关系 我是说…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cross - spectrum correlations. I mean...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.28,0:13:10.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好家伙 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}damn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:13.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,它们都是预兆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're signs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.93,0:13:17.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,征兆 如果你能追踪它们 就能追踪到那魔鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Omens. If you can track them, you can track this demon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.47,0:13:21.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,像是庄稼歉收 电子风暴{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, like crop failures, electrical storms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.41,0:13:25.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们被雷劈过吗？那可不是好玩的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever been struck by lightning?It aingt fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.34,0:13:29.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你能追踪到吗？- 是的 有了这个 我想我能{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Can you track it or not? - Yeah, with this, I think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.29,0:13:32.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但要花点时间 给我…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But it's gonna take time. Uh, give me...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.21,0:13:36.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,51小时{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}51 hours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.30,0:13:43.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 伙计 - 嗯？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hey, man. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:46.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,顺便说一下 我喜欢你的发型{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, I, uh, dig the haircut.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.30,0:13:49.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,前面的是为了工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All business up front...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.51,0:13:51.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,后面的是为了派对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and party in the back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:05.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 埃伦 那是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Ellen, what is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.75,0:14:08.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是报警器{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a police scanner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.22,0:14:12.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 小心点为好 - 不 不 不 不 那个…文件夹{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We,uh,keep tabs on things. - No,no,no.The,um,The folder.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.67,0:14:23.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我打算把这给一个朋友的 但是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was gonna give this to a friend of mine. But...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.08,0:14:24.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看看吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}take a look{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.83,0:14:25.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果你想做的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}if you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.54,0:14:28.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.66,0:14:31.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你母亲是怎么进入这行的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How'd your mom get into this stuff, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.63,0:14:32.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我的爸爸{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.85,0:14:33.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他是个猎手{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was a hunter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.35,0:14:36.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,去世了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He passed away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.33,0:14:39.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,抱歉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.79,0:14:40.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是很久以前的事了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a long time ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.47,0:14:42.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我那时还是个孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I was just a kid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.65,0:14:46.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对你爸爸的事我很遗憾{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry to hear about your dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.05,0:14:48.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.92,0:14:52.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.81,0:14:56.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想我有51个小时要消磨了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess I got 51 hours to waste.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.51,0:14:58.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许今晚我们能…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe tonight we should...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.69,0:15:06.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 你知道吗？还是算了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you know what? Never mind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.98,0:15:09.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么？- 没什么 只是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Nothing, just, uh...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.80,0:15:12.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,挑错了地点和时间{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wrong place, wrong time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.14,0:15:14.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我还以为你会向我挑逗一下呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know i thought you were gonna toss me some cheap line.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.60,0:15:16.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,大多数猎手来这里{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Most hunters come through that door{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.16,0:15:18.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,都想从我这得到些好处 像是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}think they can get in my pants with some...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.56,0:15:21.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,皮萨 肌肉 齐柏林飞艇IV的第一张唱片{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pizza, a six - pack, and Side 1 of Zeppelin IV.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.99,0:15:24.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一群卑鄙的家伙{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What a bunch of scumbags.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.30,0:15:27.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.81,0:15:30.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想也是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.07,0:15:33.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 过来下 看看这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, come here. Check this out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:36.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.29,0:15:41.08,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,埃伦找到的 几宗发生在离这不远地方的谋杀案{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A few murders, not far from here, that Ellen caught wind of.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.08,0:15:42.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看来那儿有东西可以猎杀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Looks to me like there might be a hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.97,0:15:45.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 是的 所以？- 所以{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, so? - So{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.30,0:15:46.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我告诉她我们可以去查查{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told her we'd check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.08,0:15:50.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你开玩笑吧 小丑杀手？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gotta be kidding me. A killer clown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.43,0:15:53.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 他没有伤害那女孩 却杀了她的父母{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He left the daughter unharmed and killed the parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.68,0:15:55.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,正确的说是撕成了碎片{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ripped them to pieces.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.15,0:15:57.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这家人去了什么游乐园吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This family was at a carnival that night?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.20,0:15:59.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 库珀游乐园{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. The Cooper Carnival.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.82,0:16:00.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你怎么知道我们要找的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So how do you know we're{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.46,0:16:02.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不是什么小丑装的变态的戏班演员？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}not dealing with some psycho in a clown suit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.62,0:16:04.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,警方毫无线索{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well.The cops have no viable leads{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.21,0:16:07.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而且当时所有的戏班人员都在拆设施…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and all the employees were tearing down shop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.03,0:16:07.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,都有不在场证明{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Alibis all around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.89,0:16:11.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,再说那小女孩说见到那小丑凭空消失了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Plus the girl said she saw a clown vanish into thin air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.03,0:16:12.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,警方当然会说是创伤引起的幻觉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cops are saying trauma, of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.89,0:16:14.15,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道你在想什么 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know what you're thinking, Sam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.47,0:16:16.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,“为什么会是小丑？”{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why did it have to be clowns?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.06,0:16:18.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 饶了我吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, give me a break.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.44,0:16:20.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你以为我不记得了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You didn't think I remembered, did you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:24.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你每次在电视见到麦当劳叔叔 都会哭个不停{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You still bust out crying when you see Ronald McDonald on the television.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.88,0:16:26.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,至少我不会晕机{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm not afraid of flying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.21,0:16:28.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 飞机会坠毁的 - 很显然小丑会杀人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Planes crash. - Apparently, clowns kill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.51,0:16:34.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这样的谋杀案 以前有过吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So these types of murders, they ever happen before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.18,0:16:38.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,根据记录 1981年…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}According to the file, 1981.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.38,0:16:40.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,邦克兄弟马戏团{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The Bunker Brothers Circus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.96,0:16:44.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,同样的手法 发生在三个不同的时间和地点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Same m.o. It happened three different times, three different locales.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.92,0:16:47.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有点奇怪 如果是怨灵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If it is a spirit, it's usually bound{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.38,0:16:49.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一般来说 会固定在同一个地点 房子或镇子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to a specific locale you know a house or a town.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:52.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么会从一个城市到另一个？一个表演会到另一个呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How's this one moving from carnival to carnival?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.04,0:16:53.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许是被诅咒的东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cursed object, maybe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.60,0:16:56.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怨灵让自己附在某样东西上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The spirit attaches itself to something,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:17:00.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 跟着马戏团到处走 - 好极了 超常的清道夫{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- carnival carries it around with them. - Great. Paranormal scavenger hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.94,0:17:02.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这活是你接的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This case was your idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.96,0:17:06.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,话说回来 你是怎么了？巴不得早点接下这活{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By the way, why is that?You were awfully quick to jump on this job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.70,0:17:09.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那又如何？- 这不像你的作风 就这意思{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So? - It's just not like you, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.34,0:17:13.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我还以为 你只是一心想追杀那魔鬼{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you were hell bent for leather on the demon hunt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:16.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道 只是觉得{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. I just think, taking this job,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.14,0:17:18.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸在的话 也会希望我们接下这活的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's what Dad would've wanted us to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.04,0:17:21.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 老爸希望的？- 是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What Dad would've wanted? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.72,0:17:23.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.79,0:17:28.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:37.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看看这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.80,0:17:41.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,埃文 看哪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Evan, look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.00,0:17:46.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 可怕吧 - 是的 爸爸 可怕{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Scary. - Yeah, Dad. Scary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.39,0:17:47.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那里是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's over here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.79,0:17:56.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我在你这么大的时候 这东西都会把我吓的掉裤子了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wow.You know, when I was your age, this would've scared the pants off me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.13,0:18:21.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,埃文{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:22.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.89,0:18:24.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.54,0:18:27.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.15,0:18:29.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我看到一个小丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw a clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.89,0:18:33.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别害怕小丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't be afraid of clowns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:36.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们很友好 是你的朋友{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're nice. They're your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.05,0:18:38.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吗？走吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay? Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.43,0:18:52.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.34,0:18:55.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.27,0:18:58.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,埃文{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Evan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.44,0:18:59.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么事？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.97,0:19:01.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你说的对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.17,0:19:03.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他是我的朋友{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He is my friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.08,0:19:32.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看看这个{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check it out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.10,0:19:33.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,5点钟的位置{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.67,0:19:58.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,拿到她的号码了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you get her number?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.13,0:20:05.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 又有谋杀案了？- 昨晚又死了两个人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- More murders? - Two more last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.49,0:20:07.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,被撕成了碎片{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They were ripped to shreds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.02,0:20:08.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,旁边还有一个男孩{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And they had a little boy with them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.83,0:20:10.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,说是小丑干的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who fingered a clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.57,0:20:15.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:18.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 一个凭空消失的小丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, a clown, who vanished into thin air.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.08,0:20:21.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 你知道 找一件被诅咒的物品{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, you know, looking for a cursed object, it's like...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.16,0:20:25.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,就像是大海捞针 任何东西都可能是的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trying to find a needle in a stack of needles. It could be anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.04,0:20:29.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这时EMF就派上用场了 我们只要扫描每一样东西就行了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's bound to give off EMFs. We'll just have to scan everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.31,0:20:33.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 好极了 那样做一点都不会引人注意啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, good. That's nice and inconspicuous.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.94,0:20:35.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只要我们混进去就行了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess we'll just have to blend in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:48.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.19,0:20:51.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们在找库珀先生 你有见过他吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're looking for a Mr. Cooper. Have you seen him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.74,0:20:53.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是什么意思？玩笑话吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What is that, some kind of joke?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.37,0:20:59.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 哦 天哪 抱歉 - 你以为我一点都不想{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, God, I'm sorry. - You think I wouldn't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.64,0:21:04.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,看到库珀先生或者日落吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}give my eyeteeth to see Mr. Cooper or a sunset or anything at all?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.26,0:21:05.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你不来帮我一把吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna give me a little help here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.54,0:21:06.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真的不了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not really.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.49,0:21:08.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 巴里 出什么事了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, Barry, is there a problem?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.78,0:21:13.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 这家伙讨厌瞎子 - 不 我没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah, this guy hates blind people. - No, I don't{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:16.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 嘿 伙计 你怎么回事？- 没事 只是有点误会{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's your problem? - It's just a little misunderstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.56,0:21:17.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有点？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}"Little"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.58,0:21:19.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你这该死的 - 不 不 不 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You son of a bitch. - No, I'm just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.54,0:21:21.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有人能告诉我库珀先生在哪吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can somebody tell me where Mr. Cooper is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:23.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,求你们了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.65,0:21:25.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们加入的真不是时候{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You boys picked a hell of a time to join up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.01,0:21:27.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,坐吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take a seat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.88,0:21:30.45,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们正好在这里惹上了一些麻烦{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We got all kinds of local trouble.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.22,0:21:33.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.59,0:21:37.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一对夫妇被谋杀了 警察总喜欢从这查起{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A couple of folks got murdered. Cops always seem to start here first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.74,0:21:40.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们以前在游乐园做过吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you two ever worked the circuit before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.40,0:21:43.70,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,呃 是的 先生 去年在德克萨斯州和阿肯色州做过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, sir. Last year through Texas and Arkansas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.70,0:21:45.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,做什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.Doing what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.04,0:21:47.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,驯马师？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride jockeys?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.58,0:21:48.60,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,飞刀？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Butcher?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.45,0:21:51.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 空中飞人？- 是的 我们是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- A&S men? Yeah.I...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.74,0:21:53.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么都做的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Little bit of everything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.98,0:21:59.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们俩从没表演过杂技吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You two have never worked a show in your lives before, have you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.43,0:22:01.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.28,0:22:03.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但我们真的很需要这工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we really need the work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.53,0:22:07.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而且萨姆喜欢上了那个有胡子的女士{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So And Sam here has got a thing for the bearded lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.43,0:22:13.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们看到那照片了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see that picture?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.65,0:22:15.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是我父亲{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's my daddy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.18,0:22:17.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你和他长的一模一样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You look just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.39,0:22:18.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他也是做这行的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was in the business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.46,0:22:22.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,组织一种很恐怖的表演 直到大多数地方都禁止他的表演{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ran a freak show, till they outlawed them most places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.59,0:22:26.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很显然他们觉得 那些被展出的东西都很畸形{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Apparently, displaying the deformed isn't dignified.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.09,0:22:29.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以多数的表演者被送进了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So most of the performers went from honest work...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.53,0:22:31.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,医院和精神病院{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to rotting in hospitals and asylums.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.77,0:22:34.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那算进步吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That's progress,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.55,0:22:35.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.03,0:22:39.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们看到了 这地方{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You see, this place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.45,0:22:41.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是流浪者的避风港{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it's a refuge for outcasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.47,0:22:42.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一直以来都是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Always has been.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.02,0:22:45.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那些不能融入社会的人的收容所{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For folks that don't fit in nowhere else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.21,0:22:48.13,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是你们两个…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But you two...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.28,0:22:52.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,应该去上学{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you should go to school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.65,0:22:53.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,找个女朋友{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find a couple of girls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.24,0:22:56.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,生2 3个孩子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have 2.5 kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.22,0:22:57.77,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,过正常的生活{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Live regular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.36,0:23:03.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,先生…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sir?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.63,0:23:06.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们不想去上学{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We don't wanna go to school.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.25,0:23:08.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们也不想过正常的生活{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we don't want regular.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们想要这工作{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We want this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.09,0:23:16.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Huh. What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.50,0:23:20.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那一套“我不想上学”的话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That whole, uh, "I don't wanna go back to school" thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.57,0:23:21.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你只是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you just{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.11,0:23:24.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对库珀说的 还是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saying that to Cooper, or, were you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.69,0:23:25.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你知道的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you know,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.61,0:23:26.53,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,只是说说而已？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}saying it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.52,0:23:30.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我不知道 - 你不知道？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sam? - I don't know.You don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:33.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我以为只要那魔鬼一死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought once the demon was dead and the fat lady sings...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:33.44,0:23:36.64,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你就会离开 回到那个懦夫大学去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you were gonna take off, head back to Wussy State.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.09,0:23:38.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我改变主意了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm having second thoughts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.05,0:23:40.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 真的吗？- 是的 我想…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Really? - Yeah, I think.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.65,0:23:44.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,爸爸会希望我继续做下去的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dad wanted me to stick with the job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.27,0:23:46.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你什么时候开始听老爸的话？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since when do you give a damn?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.52,0:23:48.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你花了半辈子的时间 都在和他作对啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You spent your life doing what he didn't want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.73,0:23:50.48,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,从他死后 可以吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Since he died.Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.36,0:23:53.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有问题吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a problem with that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.22,0:23:58.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有 一点问题都没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, I don't have a problem at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.71,0:25:02.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那是什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you even scared? No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.58,0:25:42.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你好？- 嘿{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Hello. Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.85,0:25:44.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,怎么了？听起来你好像看到了小丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's the matter? You sound like you just saw a clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.46,0:25:46.43,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,很好笑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very funny.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:48.41,0:25:49.75,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,事实上是骨头{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Skeleton, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.90,0:25:53.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 真人的骨头？- 就在鬼屋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like a real human skeleton? - In the fun house.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.29,0:25:56.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听着 我在想 如果那怨灵不是附在被诅咒的东西上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Listen, I was thinking What if the spirit isn't attached to a cursed object?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.35,0:25:57.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而是在自己的遗骸上呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What if it's attached to remains?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.94,0:26:00.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- EMF有反应吗？- 没有 但是…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did bones give off EMF? - No, but{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.30,0:26:02.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们应该去看看 我这就去你那{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We should check it out.I'm heading to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.78,0:26:07.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你在这干什么 孩子？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing here, kid?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.34,0:26:10.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 扫垃圾 - 废话{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I was just sweeping. - Bull.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.66,0:26:13.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你刚才在说什么？骨头？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And what were you talking about? Skeletons?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.45,0:26:15.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么是EMF？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's EMF?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.18,0:26:18.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好家伙 你们盲人的听力真好{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your blind man hearing is out of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.47,0:26:20.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们是紧密的团体 不喜欢外来人{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're a tight group. We don't like outsiders.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:20.65,0:26:23.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,自己的麻烦自己处理{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We take care of our own problems.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.03,0:26:26.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我们有麻烦吗？- 你告诉我吧 不是你{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- We got a problem? - Well, you tell me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.24,0:26:28.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在那说什么人骨的啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You're the one talking about human bones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:31.59,0:26:32.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你相信鬼魂吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you believe in ghosts?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.48,0:26:34.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.43,0:26:35.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我弟弟和我…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My brother and me, um...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.58,0:26:38.90,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,正在写一本这方面的书{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we're writing a book about them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.95,0:26:43.71,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 怎么这么久？- 说来话长{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What took you so long? - Long story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.71,0:26:45.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,妈咪 快看那个小丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy, look at the clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.19,0:26:49.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么小丑？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What clown?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.84,0:26:55.58,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,走吧 宝贝 走吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on, sweetie. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:09.74,0:27:11.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 真不敢相信{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot believe{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:11.23,0:27:13.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你和帕帕说了杀人小丑的事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you told Papazian about the homicidal phantom clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.55,0:27:16.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我说的是 一个关于隐形杀人小丑的传说{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told him an urban legend about a homicidal phantom clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.47,0:27:17.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我没说那是真的 - 拿低点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I never said it was real. - Keep that down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.07,0:27:21.25,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,噢 我知道了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, and get this:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.25,0:27:23.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我说了81年邦克兄弟马戏团{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mentioned the Bunker Brothers Circus in 81...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.50,0:27:26.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,和他们邪恶小丑的事 猜猜怎么着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and their, uh, evil clown apocalypse.Guess what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.40,0:27:27.19,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:27.81,0:27:29.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在库珀先生拥有库珀游乐园前{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before Mr. Cooper owned Cooper Carnival...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:30.28,0:27:31.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他为邦克兄弟工作过{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he worked for Bunker Brothers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.67,0:27:32.87,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他曾是他们的后勤主管{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He was their lot manager.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.87,0:27:34.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以不管那怨灵附在什么东西上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Whatever the spirit's attached to,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.80,0:27:37.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 库珀一直把它带在身边？- 差不多{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cooper brought it with him? - Something like that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.99,0:27:42.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真不敢相信我们一直在讨论小丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I can't believe we keep talking about clowns.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.15,0:28:12.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,想要进来玩吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean.Wanna come in and play?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.95,0:28:32.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,想要见见妈咪和爹地吗？他们就在楼上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wanna see Mommy and Daddy? They're upstairs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.28,0:28:35.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey! Hey!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.03,0:28:46.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 小心了 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, watch out!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.16,0:28:52.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这出什么事了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's going on here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.78,0:28:54.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 天哪 你们在对我的女儿做什么 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you doing to my daughter?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.36,0:28:55.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,离我的孩子远点 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get out! Get out of my house!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.04,0:28:58.00,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,妈咪 爹地 他们开枪打了我的小丑{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Mommy, Daddy, they shot my clown.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.52,0:29:10.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们真的看到我们的车牌了吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You really think they saw our plates?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.86,0:29:13.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我可不想冒险{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't wanna take the chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.54,0:29:15.56,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,再说 我讨厌这怪东西{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Besides, I hate this freaking thing anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:17.72,0:29:19.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有件事是肯定的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, one thing's for sure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.38,0:29:20.37,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What's that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.14,0:29:22.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们对付的不是一个鬼魂{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We're not dealing with a spirit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.89,0:29:24.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,盐弹打到的是实体{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That rock salt hit something solid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.86,0:29:28.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 一个人 或是一个可以隐形的生物吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah. A person? Or maybe a creature that can make itself invisible?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.49,0:29:30.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 而且穿成小丑来吸引小孩？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And dresses up like a clown for kicks?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:30.50,0:29:31.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在老爸的日记里有记录吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did it says anything in Dad's journal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.95,0:29:32.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nope.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.23,0:29:37.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你打给谁？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who you calling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.43,0:29:39.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许埃伦 或者那个叫阿什的会知道些什么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Maybe Ellen or that guy Ash will know something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.73,0:29:42.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, you think, uh ?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.00,0:29:44.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你觉得爸爸是不是喜欢过埃伦？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think Dad and Ellen ever had a thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.27,0:29:46.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不可能{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.49,0:29:48.26,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那为什么他不告诉我们？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then why didn't he tell us about her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.65,0:29:50.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不知道 也许他们闹翻了吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know. Maybe they had some sort of falling out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.65,0:29:52.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:54.86,0:29:57.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你看到过爸爸和谁闹翻过吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You ever notice Dad had a falling out with just about everybody?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.23,0:30:03.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,别跟我玩深沉{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, don't get all maudlin on the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.86,0:30:04.68,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:05.29,0:30:09.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我指你那种深沉凝重的表情 我才不吃那套呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This strong, silent thing of yours. It's crap. I'm over it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:09.11,0:30:11.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们说的不是别人 是爸爸啊{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This isn't just anyone. This is Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.39,0:30:13.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道你对他的感受{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I know how you felt about the man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:13.11,0:30:16.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,剩剩吧 就因为我不是那样的多愁善感…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Back off, all right? Just because I'm not caring and sharing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.30,0:30:19.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不 不是这个 迪恩 我不管你是怎么接受的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, that's not what this is about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.24,0:30:21.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你必须接受爸爸的死{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't care how you deal with this, but you have to deal with it, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.53,0:30:24.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听着 我是你的兄弟 我只是想确认你真的没事{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm your brother. I wanna make sure you're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.84,0:30:26.72,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哥们 我没事 我没事 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dude, I'm okay. I'm okay, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:26.73,0:30:28.84,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果还有人问我有没有事 我发誓{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The next person who asks me if I'm okay,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:28.84,0:30:30.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一定先给他一拳{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna start throwing punches.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.54,0:30:32.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这些是你的事 别冲着我来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}These are your issues. Quit dumping them on me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.86,0:30:33.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你在说什么呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.82,0:30:36.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我对你突然间服从老爸觉得好奇{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's really interesting......this obedience you have to Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.65,0:30:38.51,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,像是 “哦 爸爸会要我做什么呢？”{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's like, "Oh, what would Dad want?"{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.89,0:30:41.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你一生都在和他作对{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You spent your life slugging it out with that man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.32,0:30:43.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我是说 上一次你看到他时 还是你挑起争吵的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You picked a fight with him the last time you saw him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.95,0:30:45.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在他死了 你才想要改正吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now that he's dead you wanna make it right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:45.99,0:30:48.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,对不起了 萨姆 你改不了了 太少也太迟了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sorry, but you can't. It's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.55,0:30:49.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,为什么这么说我？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why are you saying this to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.70,0:30:53.46,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想你好好面对自己 我已经接受老爸的死了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to be honest with yourself.I'm dealing with Dad's death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:53.93,0:30:54.83,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你呢？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.69,0:31:01.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我要给埃伦打电话了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm gonna call Ellen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.53,0:31:14.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,太感谢了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks a lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.81,0:31:18.10,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是罗刹{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Rakshasa.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.70,0:31:21.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 什么东西？- 埃伦说最有可能是这个了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What's that? - Ellen's best guess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.39,0:31:25.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一种古印度怪物 他们能呈现人形{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a race of ancient Hindu creatures.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.07,0:31:27.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,以人肉为生{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They appear in human form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.34,0:31:29.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,可以使自己隐身{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They feed on human flesh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.04,0:31:31.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没有别人的邀请 他们进不了房屋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}.They cannot enter a home without first being invited.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.82,0:31:34.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以他们穿成小丑 让孩子们请他们进去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So they dress up like clowns and the children invite them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.37,0:31:36.63,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 他们为什么不吃孩子？- 不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why don't they munch on the kids? - Don't know{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.81,0:31:38.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,肉太少了吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not enough meat, maybe?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.28,0:31:41.61,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 还有什么？- 罗刹住在很肮脏的地方{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What else you find out? - Apparently, rakshasas live in squalor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.99,0:31:44.69,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,睡在用死昆虫铺成的床上{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They sleep on a bed of dead insects.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.58,0:31:48.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,他们的餐数很少 每20到30年一次{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nice. And they have to feed a few times......every 20 to 30 years.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.38,0:31:50.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我猜他们的新陈代谢很慢吧 - 说的过去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Slow metabolism, I guess. - Makes sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.80,0:31:53.79,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这年是在游乐园 81年是在邦克兄弟马戏团{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, the carnival today, the Bunker Brothers in 81.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.80,0:31:56.06,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也许以前还有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right. Probably more before that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:56.26,0:31:58.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 谁在两个地方都做过事？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Who do we know that worked both shows?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:58.40,0:32:00.07,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 库珀 - 库珀{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Cooper - Cooper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.40,0:32:03.27,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那张他父亲的照片{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know, that picture of his father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:03.53,0:32:04.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,和他一模一样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that looked just like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.69,0:32:07.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你觉得就是他吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You think maybe it was him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:07.91,0:32:09.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谁知道他几岁了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, who knows how old he is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.67,0:32:10.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,埃伦有说怎么杀死他吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ellen say how to kill him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.47,0:32:14.49,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,传说中是用纯铜的匕首{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Legend goes, a dagger made of pure brass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:16.53,0:32:18.44,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我想我知道去哪可以弄到一把{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I know where to get one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.44,0:32:21.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在刺穿库珀前 我们得弄清楚是不是他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Before we go stabbing things into Cooper, we wanna make sure it's him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:21.65,0:32:24.33,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 你真是小心谨慎的家伙 萨姆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, you're such a stickler for detail, Sammy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.02,0:32:26.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 我去找武器{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, I'll round up the blade.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.06,0:32:29.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你去查查库珀的睡床{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You go check if Cooper's got bedbugs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.77,0:32:53.32,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我有各种各样的刀子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, I got all kinds of knives.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.61,0:32:56.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不知道有没有铜的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know if I got a brass one, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:04.83,0:33:05.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你在做什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think you're doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:08.26,0:33:09.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,去箱子里看看{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check the trunk.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.43,0:33:27.29,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.55,0:33:32.66,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是我{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.07,0:33:49.18,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好了 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Jeez.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.46,0:33:51.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,天哪{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.88,0:33:54.89,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.56,0:33:56.35,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.23,0:33:59.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,库珀把我当成了偷窥狂 但他不是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Cooper thinks I'm a peeping Tom, but it's not him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.92,0:34:01.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是的 所以我过来了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yeah, so I gathered.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.18,0:34:02.91,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,是那个瞎子 他就在这儿什么地方{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's the blind guy. He's here somewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.91,0:34:05.09,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你有拿到… - 铜刀吗？没有{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Did you get...? - The brass blades?No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.09,0:34:06.65,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,真是倒霉的日子{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, it's just been one of those days.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.91,0:34:09.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我有办法 快来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I got an idea. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.18,0:34:22.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,迪恩 找到出路 好吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dean, find the maze, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.86,0:35:03.80,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 在哪？- 不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Where is it?I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.80,0:35:05.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我们不是应该看得到他的衣服吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shouldn't we see his clothes walking around?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.41,0:35:22.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 迪恩 他在哪？- 我不知道 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Dean, where his he? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.71,0:35:38.98,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,萨姆 背后 {\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sam, behind you! Behind you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.93,0:36:07.54,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我讨厌鬼屋{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I hate fun houses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.67,0:36:25.14,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,小伙子们干得不错嘛{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You boys did a hell of a job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.31,0:36:27.17,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 你们父亲一定会自豪的 - 谢谢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your dad would be proud. - Thanks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.94,0:36:38.12,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,哦 是的 我得 呃…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, yeah, um, I've gotta Uh Uh{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.92,0:36:41.21,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我得去…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gotta go...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.65,0:36:42.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,那儿了…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}over there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.17,0:36:44.42,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,现在就去{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.31,0:36:51.16,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 那么 - 那么{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- So? Ahem... - So?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.77,0:36:54.04,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我还能见到你吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I gonna see you again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.93,0:36:58.05,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你想吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you want to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.10,0:37:01.36,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不会讨厌的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wouldn't hate it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:02.17,0:37:03.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我能对你说实话吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can I be honest with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.69,0:37:04.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你瞧 通常{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See, normally,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.82,0:37:07.34,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我早就把你迷倒了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'd be hitting on you so fast it would make your head spin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:07.71,0:37:08.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.20,0:37:11.39,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,这些日子…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}these days...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.55,0:37:13.38,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我不知道{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.95,0:37:15.02,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,错误的地点{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wrong place...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.75,0:37:17.11,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,错误的时间吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}wrong time?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.70,0:37:19.97,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,没关系 我明白{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's okay, I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.31,0:37:25.30,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你们去哪了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where have you guys been?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.44,0:37:28.41,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 我正等着你们呢 - 我们去干活了 阿什{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Been waiting for you. - We were working a job, Ash.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.73,0:37:32.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,- 小丑？- 小丑？什么…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Clowns? - Clowns? What the ?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.01,0:37:33.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,有事告诉我们吗 阿什？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Got something for us, Ash?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.11,0:37:35.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你找到那魔鬼了？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you find the demon?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:35.73,0:37:36.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,不在附近{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's nowhere around.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.14,0:37:38.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,至少我没有找到{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least, nowhere I can find.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.86,0:37:41.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但是如果这狗娘养的一出现{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if this fugly bastard raises its head, I'll know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.11,0:37:45.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我就会知道 就像鲨鱼闻到血腥一样{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, I'm on it like Divine on dog dookie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.88,0:37:46.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,什么意思？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.60,0:37:48.85,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,意思是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.57,0:37:52.73,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,在世界任何地方 只要有类似的征兆或预兆{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}any of those signs or omens appear anywhere in the world...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.74,0:37:55.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我的设备就会让火警一样响起来{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}my rig will go off.Like a fire alarm.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:56.46,0:37:57.57,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你介意吗？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would you mind...?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.01,0:38:03.03,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,干什么呢 伙计？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yeah. - What's up, man?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.00,0:38:06.86,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,阿什 你从哪学到这些的？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where did you learn to do all this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.86,0:38:10.99,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,麻省理工大学 在我因打架被赶出去前{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}MIT. Before I got bounced for fighting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.25,0:38:14.23,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,麻省理工大学？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- MIT?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.50,0:38:15.88,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,波士顿的一所学校{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a school in Boston.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:16.78,0:38:17.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.19,0:38:19.74,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,发现什么就尽快通知我们吧？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Give us a call as soon as you know something?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.32,0:38:22.01,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,听你们的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Si. Si, compadre.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:33.17,0:38:34.52,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,嘿 听着{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Hey, listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.35,0:38:38.31,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,如果你们想找个地方住 我这里有地方{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If you boys need a place to stay, I got a couple beds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:39.82,0:38:40.95,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,谢谢 不过不需要{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thanks, but no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.15,0:38:43.76,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,还有些事要做呢{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, there's something I gotta finish.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.76,0:38:44.59,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,好吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.91,0:39:00.78,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你是对的{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:02.31,0:39:03.20,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,关于什么？{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.87,0:39:08.92,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,关于我和爸爸{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}About me and Dad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.90,0:39:12.81,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,抱歉上次和他在一起的时候 我挑起了争吵{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry that the last time I was with him, I tried to pick a fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.25,0:39:15.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也能抱歉我一直都在生他的气{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry that I spent most of my life angry at him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:15.76,0:39:17.47,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我知道的就是 到他死时{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I mean, for all I know, he died thinking that I hate him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:17.59,0:39:18.93,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,也觉得我在恨他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.13,0:39:22.28,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,所以你说对了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What I'm doing right now,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.42,0:39:26.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我现在做的太少了…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}it is too little.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.82,0:39:29.82,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,太迟了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:35.27,0:39:36.67,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我很想他{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I miss him, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.63,0:39:41.24,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,觉得内疚极了{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I feel guilty as hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.12,0:39:46.50,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,而且我没有没事…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I'm not all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:48.56,0:39:49.62,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,一点都没…{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.36,0:39:59.55,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,但你也是{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But neither are you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.33,0:40:02.40,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,我就知道这些{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That much I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.75,0:40:08.22,CMCT中英双语,,0,0,0,,你继续修车吧{\r}\N{\blur3\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'll let you get back to work.{\r}
